@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Run owned native WAL checkpoint maintenance separately from request commits while keeping FULL commit durability and send recovery. Expose account-scoped read-only storage maintenance health independently of profile and control-store queries, and stop maintenance when the native runtime shuts down.
+The daemon joins checkpoint maintenance before returning from serve, including setup and server failures, while leaving in-flight result persistence handles open.
